Z||000000||GodSend||08-18-2000||06:39 PM||||  I was just wondering if there is any space under the center arm rest (rear lower section between the shifter and the upright storage compartment).<P>  My plan, if fisable, is to convert the empty space in that area into a small bandpass box for a 8" or 10" sub.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Xtreme Fiero's||08-18-2000||07:18 PM||||there isn't enough room for a box like that. You can fit a free air 8" sub, But is you want real bass (near 140db) look into a Kicker Solobaric 8" Square sub or two in a box between the seats. this would cost more but will sound awsome. just to compare, a 8" Kicker will sound better than many standard 10's and 12's. and it is looking like the 8" solo will need .10-.25 cu. ft. of air and will NEED about 600-800 watts to realy sound awsome.||||reg||1
